<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mixed in active trading Monday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 100.46 to 6905.25.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 3.20 to 416.00.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.32.</p>
<p>Losers beat winners 1320 to 1169.</p>
<p>Volume was 442,145,450 compared with 534,371,130 on Friday.</p>
